 is actually equivalent to: 

      public  void declarationOneLineForEach() {
        CSVFormat csvFormat = CSVFormat.newFormat( ',' );
        assertEquals( " 'x' , ' y ' , 'z' " , csvFormat.format(strings));
    }


 I guess this explains the behavior you observed.

